# caps — session limits surfaced as diagnostics (§5): a >4096-slot word is
# beyond the typechecker's own analysis floor (a native diagnostic surfaced
# verbatim — FR-11), and an oversized definition submission is rejected at the
# SESSION boundary (E9154, §7.5). `@repeat` keeps the script readable; the
# gate is byte-exact on the expanded text.
:fuel 100000
: flood ( -- ) @repeat 4100 [1 ] @repeat 4100 [drop ] ;
flood
: huge ( -- ) @repeat 17000 [0 ] @repeat 17000 [drop ] ;
:stack
:ir